OL,3,GNEWSAOff-roaders caught damaging
OL,4,Aprotected site after posting videos to
OL,5,ATikTok
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have been convicted after
OL,8,Fvideos of them using off-road vehicles
OL,9,Fto cause "irreversible" harm to a
OL,10,Fprotected area were posted to TikTok.
OL,12,FJohn Robinson, Michael Williams and
OL,13,FJoseph Hodgson were part of a convoy
OL,14,Fthat drove the vehicles from Liverpool
OL,15,Fto the Berwyn Site of Special
OL,16,FScientific Interest (SSSI),
OL,17,FDenbighshire.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
