OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOff-roaders caught damaging
OL,4,Aprotected site after posting videos to
OL,5,ATikTok
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobinson and Williams were fined more
OL,8,Fthan #2,000 each and disqualified from
OL,9,Fdriving for two months, while Hodgson
OL,10,Fdid not attend court but was found
OL,11,Fguilty of criminal damage in his
OL,12,Fabsence.
OL,14,FKirsty Roberts, from Natural Resources
OL,15,FWales (NRW), said SSSIs were protected
OL,16,Fbecause they "support the UK's most
OL,17,Fimportant" and fragile wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
